          "comment": "[Playbook] The Agreement contains no insurance covenant, so we have added a short Section 18.15 requiring Array to carry commercial general liability (including products and clinical trial liability), professional liability and, where it handles our confidential or personal data, cyber cover, with certificates on request. This backs up Array's indemnity and recall obligations under Article 16; we can discuss reduced limits (E&O USD 1M / cyber USD 2M) if the stated amounts exceed Array's current programme.",
