              "kind": "insert_after",
              "paragraphId": "p0796",
              "numbering": "18.15",
              "text": "18.15 Insurance. Array shall maintain, at its own expense, throughout the Term and for one (1) year thereafter: (a) commercial general liability insurance (including products liability and, in respect of any Clinical Studies conducted by or on behalf of Array, clinical trial liability) of not less than USD 1,000,000 per occurrence and USD 2,000,000 in the aggregate; (b) professional liability (errors and omissions) insurance of not less than USD 2,000,000; (c) to the extent Array processes any personal data or other Confidential Information of Ono, cyber liability insurance of not less than USD 5,000,000; and (d) workers' compensation insurance as required by applicable Law. Array shall provide Ono with certificates of insurance evidencing such coverage upon request."
